# Root Cargo.lock: engine pins its own lock file; the root lock would be
# regenerated as version 4 by modern cargo, which old cargo (1.75) cannot parse.
# Keep the v4 copy in the tree as Cargo.lock.v4-unused for reference.
/Cargo.lock
bin/
engine/ort.so

